        <headline>Flood Warning issued September 25 at 11:23AM MDT until September 25 at 11:30AM MDT by NWS Albuquerque NM</headline>
        <description>The Flood Warning will expire at 1130 AM MDT this morning for
portions of central, east central, and southeast New Mexico,
including the following areas, in central New Mexico, Lincoln. In
east central New Mexico, Curry and Roosevelt. In southeast New
Mexico, Chaves.

Flood waters have receded. Flooding is no longer expected to pose a
threat.

A Flood Watch remains in effect until 1200 AM MDT Saturday for
portions of central, east central, and southeast New Mexico...
</description>
